  "description": "Generic serial-port KISS modem implementing IAx25Transport for the Packet.NET stack. Opens a USB-CDC or hardware serial port, speaks KISS framing in both directions, and surfaces inbound frames as an async stream. Pair with Packet.Kiss.NinoTnc for NinoTNC-specific extensions (ACKMODE, SetMode, frame classification). Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
